  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice pear into wedges. Grate carrot. Cut firm tofu into 1cm-wide sticks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tofu and Asian BBQ seasoning.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, sesame seeds and a splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d036eca20a4fa52b4235d/step-c2418b00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, gently turning until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Remove from heat, then add sweet chilli sauce mixture, tossing to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d036eca20a4fa52b4235d/step-cc0a9a10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, carrot, pear and a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• In a second small bowl, combine the mayonnaise and soy sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d036eca20a4fa52b4235d/step-9da47120.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Build tacos by spreading the soy mayo over tortillas, then filling with salad and tofu to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d036eca20a4fa52b4235d/step-1d6d5330.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
